## Settings to Copy

Paste these into your `settings.json` for a more polished feel:

```json
{
  "editor.cursorSmoothCaretAnimation": "on",
  "editor.cursorBlinking": "expand",
  "editor.linkedEditing": true,
  "explorer.compactFolders": false,
  "workbench.list.smoothScrolling": true,
  "editor.bracketPairColorization.enabled": true
}
```

Each one removes friction:
- Smooth cursor motion feels better
- Linked editing speeds up tag/variable renaming
- Expanded folders make your tree readable
- Smooth scrolling is less jarring
- Bracket colors help you track nesting

