## How to Use This

1. Pick a dotfiles repo that matches your OS/shell
2. Copy what actually matters (don't cargo-cult everything)
3. Add extensions as you hit workflow pain points
4. Tweak `settings.json` until it feels *right*

The best config is one you understand and use, not one you inherited.
